  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:<span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(46, 27, 34); float: none; display: inline;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(46, 27, 34); float: none; display: inline;\">At&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(46, 27, 34);\">Boricosta</strong><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(46, 27, 34); float: none; display: inline;\">, coffee is more than just a drink&mdash;it&rsquo;s a commitment to&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(46, 27, 34);\">quality, authenticity, and a passion for excellence</strong><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(46, 27, 34); float: none; display: inline;\">. We meticulously select the finest coffee beans from sustainable farms, ensuring ethical sourcing and unparalleled freshness</span>&nbsp;</span><br>&bull; Product description:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div style=\"box-sizing: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgba(31, 31, 33, 0.75); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(239, 191, 4);\" class=\"rich-text__text rte\">\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-top: 0px;\">At&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Boricosta</strong>, we bring the vibrant essence of the tropics straight to your cup. Rooted in a passion for&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">naturally grown, fresh-roasted coffee</strong>, we celebrate the rich flavors, aromas, and traditions that make every sip an unforgettable experience.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">From&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">bold single-origin selections to masterfully crafted blends and indulgent flavored roasts</strong>, our coffee is always roasted fresh to order, ensuring peak flavor and quality.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px;\">We&rsquo;re more than just coffee&mdash;we&rsquo;re a&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">taste of paradise</strong>, a journey to where coffee is grown with care and served with heart. At Boricosta, every cup is a celebration of nature, tradition, and the joy of truly great coffee.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): variety of coffee bean flavors and grind types<br>&bull; Payment terms: paypal<br>&bull; Other information:</p>\r\n</div>",
